      "context_excerpt": "The optimizations are available on the NVIDIA/TensorRT-LLM GitHub repository, where developers can use the deployment guide to launch their high-performance server. The guide downloads the model checkpoints from Hugging Face. NVIDIA collaborated on the developer experience using the Transformers library with the new models. The guide then provides a Docker container and guidance on how to configure performance for both low-latency and max-throughput cases.",
